### Payven SanalPOS API — .http koleksiyonu
# VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client / Visual Studio uyumlu.
#
# Sozlesme: wire snake_case · tutarlar kurus (long; 15000 = 150,00 TL)
#           tarihler Turkiye saati, +03:00 offsetli
#           mutasyon POST'larinda Idempotency-Key — ayni anahtarla tekrar
#           gonderim ilk yaniti doner, cift cekim olmaz
#
# Once @client_id / @client_secret doldurun, sonra "Token Al" istegini calistirip
# donen access_token degerini @access_token satirina yapistirin.

# SanalPOS API taban adresi (prod: https://vpos.payven.com.tr)
@vpos_base_url = https://vpos-sandbox.payven.com.tr
# Identity taban adresi (prod: https://identity.payven.com.tr)
@identity_base_url = https://identity-sandbox.payven.com.tr
# Tenant slug
@slug = payven
# Service-account client id (pvk_test_... / pvk_live_...)
@client_id = <client_id>
# Service-account secret
@client_secret = <client_secret>
# Kullanici login akisi icin (opsiyonel)
@username = <username>
# Kullanici login akisi icin (opsiyonel)
@password = <password>
# Pre-request script otomatik doldurur
@access_token = <access_token>
# Refresh akisi otomatik doldurur
@refresh_token = <refresh_token>
# Pre-request script doldurur — token yenileme zamani (epoch ms)
@token_expires_at = <token_expires_at>
# OTP akisinda login yaniti otomatik doldurur
@challenge_id = <challenge_id>
# Bayi dis kimligi (X-External-Merchant-Id)
@external_merchant_id = <external_merchant_id>
# Bayi Guid (X-Merchant-Id)
@merchant_id = <merchant_id>
# Connector konfigurasyon Guid — ilgili istek otomatik doldurur
@connector_config_id = <connector_config_id>
# Bayi-banka profili Guid — ilgili istek otomatik doldurur
@bank_profile_id = <bank_profile_id>
# Odeme yaniti otomatik doldurur
@transaction_id = <transaction_id>
# Checkout session yaniti otomatik doldurur
@session_id = <session_id>
# Recurring plan yaniti otomatik doldurur
@recurring_plan_id = <recurring_plan_id>
# Webhook abonelik yaniti otomatik doldurur
@webhook_id = <webhook_id>
@api_version = v1


########## Auth

### 1. Token Al — Key + Secret (Identity /token)
# Key/secret ile token (client_credentials) — Identity uzerinden. Cevap LOGIN ile AYNI shape: { token: { access_token, refresh_token, ... }, challenge: null }.
# 
# SOZLESME: access_token 300 sn gecerlidir — token CACHE'LENIR, her istekte yeniden alinmaz (/token limiti IP basina 10/dk). Donen refresh_token realm SSO oturumuna baglidir: 2 saat bosta kalma, 10 saat sert tavan. Daha uzun omur icin "1b. Offline Token Al" kullanin.
POST {{identity_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/auth/{{slug}}/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "{{client_id}}",
  "client_secret": "{{client_secret}}"
}

### 1b. Offline Token Al — uzun omurlu refresh (Identity /token)
# Uzun omurlu (offline) refresh token ister. ON KOSUL: key Portal > API Anahtarlari ekraninda "Uzun omurlu (offline) refresh token" ACIK olarak olusturulmus/guncellenmis olmali — izin yoksa Keycloak sessizce NORMAL token doner (refresh_expires_in degerinden anlarsiniz).
# 
# Offline refresh token 30 gun bosta kalma suresiyle yasar ve sert tavani yoktur. Sizarsa uzun sure kullanilabilecegi icin secret gibi saklanir; iptal Portal'dan key silme / secret yenileme / izni kapatma ile ANINDA yapilir.
POST {{identity_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/auth/{{slug}}/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "{{client_id}}",
  "client_secret": "{{client_secret}}",
  "offline": true
}

### 2. Token Al — Kullanici Adi + Sifre (Identity /login)
# Kullanici adi/sifre ile login — Identity uzerinden. Cevap: { token: {...}, challenge: null } (OTP kapali, token kaydedilir) VEYA { token: null, challenge: {...} } (OTP zorunlu; challenge_id kaydedilir, 3. OTP Dogrula calistir, dev kod 1234).
POST {{identity_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/auth/{{slug}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. OTP Dogrula (Identity /verify-otp)
# Login OTP challenge dondurduyse kodu burada dogrula -> token doner. Dev/dummy mode kod 1234. challenge_id login adiminda otomatik dolar.
POST {{identity_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/auth/{{slug}}/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "challenge_id": "{{challenge_id}}",
  "code": "1234"
}

### 4. Token Yenile (Identity /refresh)
# Refresh token ile yeni access token alir. Keycloak refresh token'i ROTATE eder — cevaptaki YENI refresh_token saklanir, eskisi atilir.
# 
# 401 govdesindeki code alani ne yapilacagini soyler:
POST {{identity_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/auth/{{slug}}/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

### 4. OTP Tekrar Gonder (resend-otp)
# OTP kodunu yeniden gonderir. Cooldown aktifse 429 (`Retry-After` header) doner. Cevap yeni `OtpChallengeDto`.
POST {{identity_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/auth/{{slug}}/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "challenge_id": "{{challenge_id}}"
}


########## Bayi Yonetimi (Identity)

### 1. Listele
GET {{identity_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/merchants?page=1&page_size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 2. Olustur (tekli)
# **Alanlar:** `name`, `tax_id` zorunlu. `external_id` bos birakirsaniz otomatik (`M-{14char}`) uretilir. `merchant_type`: individual|sole_trader|corporate|unspecified. `marketplace_role`: none|platform|sub_merchant. SubMerchant icin `parent_id` + `payout_iban` + `payout_iban_owner` zorunlu.
POST {{identity_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/merchants
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme Trading AS",
  "legal_name": "Acme Trading Anonim Sirketi",
  "tax_id": "1234567890",
  "tax_office": "Besiktas",
  "external_id": "ACME-001",
  "email": "info@acme.example.com",
  "contact_phone": "+902121112233",
  "city": "Istanbul",
  "district": "Besiktas",
  "address": "Barbaros Bulvari No:1",
  "default_mcc": "5411",
  "merchant_type": "corporate",
  "status": "approved"
}

### 3. Detay
GET {{identity_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/merchants/{{merchant_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 4. Bulk Olustur (onboarding) ⭐
# **Onboarding icin toplu bayi olusturma — tek HTTP cagrisinda N bayi (max 500).**
# 
# **Auth:** `tenant-admin`.
POST {{identity_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/merchants/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "name": "Acme Mart #1",
    "tax_id": "1111111111",
    "external_id": "ACME-001",
    "email": "m1@acme.example.com",
    "merchant_type": "corporate",
    "default_mcc": "5411"
  },
  {
    "name": "Acme Mart #2",
    "tax_id": "2222222222",
    "external_id": "ACME-002",
    "email": "m2@acme.example.com",
    "merchant_type": "corporate",
    "default_mcc": "5411"
  },
  {
    "name": "Acme Mart #3",
    "tax_id": "3333333333",
    "external_id": "ACME-003",
    "email": "m3@acme.example.com",
    "merchant_type": "corporate",
    "default_mcc": "5411"
  }
]

### 5. Guncelle
PUT {{identity_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/merchants/{{merchant_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme Trading AS (Guncel)",
  "email": "yeni@acme.example.com",
  "contact_phone": "+902121112299"
}

### 6. Sil
# Hard delete. Auth: `tenant-admin`.
DELETE {{identity_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/merchants/{{merchant_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


########## Connector Konfigleri (SanalPos)

### Listele
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/connectors?page=1&page_size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 2. Connector Konfigurasyonlarini Listele ⭐
# Tenant duzeyinde tanimli banka konfigurasyonlari (PaginatedList). **Banka profilinde kullanilan `connector_config_id` buradaki `id`'dir.**
# 
# Her item (`ConnectorConfigurationDto`):
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/connector-configurations?page=1&page_size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


########## Bayi Banka Profilleri (SanalPos)

### 1. Bayinin Profillerini Listele
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/merchants/{{merchant_id}}/bank-profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 2. Profil Olustur (tekli)
# **Alanlar:**
# - `connector_config_id` (zorunlu) — Connector Konfigleri klasorunden alin
# - `sub_merchant_id` — bankanin bayiye verdigi alt-uye/terminal id
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/merchants/{{merchant_id}}/bank-profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "connector_config_id": "{{connector_config_id}}",
  "sub_merchant_id": "700000000001",
  "sub_merchant_name": "Acme Mart #1",
  "sub_merchant_mcc": "5411",
  "sub_merchant_city": "Istanbul",
  "sub_merchant_country_code": "792",
  "sub_merchant_postal_code": "34000",
  "extra_properties": {
    "terminal_sub_id": "VP000001"
  },
  "require_cvv": true,
  "allow_non_3d": false
}

### 3. Bulk Profil Olustur (onboarding) ⭐
# **Onboarding icin toplu banka profili olusturma — tek HTTP cagrisinda N profil (max 500).**
# 
# **Auth:** `CanManageMerchants`.
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/merchant-bank-profiles/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "external_merchant_id": "ACME-001",
    "connector_config_id": "{{connector_config_id}}",
    "sub_merchant_id": "700000000001",
    "sub_merchant_name": "Acme Mart #1",
    "sub_merchant_mcc": "5411",
    "sub_merchant_city": "Istanbul",
    "sub_merchant_country_code": "792",
    "extra_properties": { "terminal_sub_id": "VP000001" },
    "require_cvv": true,
    "allow_non_3d": false,
    "min_installment_amount_kurus": 10000
  },
  {
    "merchant_id": "{{merchant_id}}",
    "connector_config_id": "{{connector_config_id}}",
    "sub_merchant_id": "700000000002",
    "require_cvv": true,
    "allow_non_3d": false
  }
]

### 4. Guncelle
PUT {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/merchants/{{merchant_id}}/bank-profiles/{{bank_profile_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub_merchant_id": "700000000001",
  "sub_merchant_name": "Acme Mart #1 (Guncel)",
  "sub_merchant_mcc": "5411",
  "sub_merchant_city": "Istanbul",
  "sub_merchant_country_code": "792",
  "extra_properties": { "terminal_sub_id": "VP000001" },
  "require_cvv": true,
  "allow_non_3d": false
}

### 5. Sil
DELETE {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/merchants/{{merchant_id}}/bank-profiles/{{bank_profile_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


########## Odemeler (Payments)

### Non-3D Odeme (Sale)
# Direkt (Non-3D) Sale. `amount` NESTED bir nesnedir (`{ amount, currency }`). `amount.amount` kurus cinsindendir.
# 
# **Not:** Tenant policy `allow_non_3d=false` (default) ise bu istek `PV_NON_3D_NOT_ALLOWED` ile reddedilir — bu durumda **3D Secure > 1. 3D Baslat** akisini kullanin.
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
X-External-Merchant-Id: {{external_merchant_id}}

{
  "external_id": "ORDER-{{$timestamp}}",
  "basket_id": "BASKET-001",
  "amount": {
    "amount": 15000,
    "currency": "TRY"
  },
  "installment": 1,
  "operation_type": "sale",
  "description": "Test odemesi",
  "card": {
    "holder_name": "TEST USER",
    "number": "5500000000000004",
    "expire_month": "12",
    "expire_year": "2030",
    "cvv": "123"
  },
  "buyer": {
    "id": "BUYER-001",
    "name": "Ahmet",
    "surname": "Yilmaz",
    "email": "ahmet@example.com",
    "phone": "+905551234567",
    "ip_address": "1.2.3.4",
    "identity_number": "11111111111"
  },
  "billing_address": {
    "contact_name": "Ahmet Yilmaz",
    "city": "Istanbul",
    "country": "Turkey",
    "address": "Ornek mah. No:1",
    "postal_code": "34000"
  }
}

### Odeme Detayi (Get)
# Payven tarafindaki islem detayini (status, tutar, kart maskesi) doner.
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/payments/{{transaction_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Banka Durum Sorgusu (Query)
# Bankaya canli durum sorgusu yapar (yan etkisiz).
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/payments/{{transaction_id}}/query
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Siparis Gecmisi (History)
# Hem internal (Payven) hem provider (banka) islem gecmisini doner.
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/payments/{{transaction_id}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Capture (PreAuth -> tahsilat)
# PreAuth (on provizyon) ile yapilmis bir odemenin tutarini tahsil eder. `amount` opsiyonel — bos birakilirsa tam tutar capture edilir (kismi capture icin tutar verin).
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/payments/{{transaction_id}}/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
X-External-Merchant-Id: {{external_merchant_id}}

{
  "amount": {
    "amount": 15000,
    "currency": "TRY"
  },
  "reason": "Siparis tamamlandi"
}

### Iade (Refund)
# Tamamlanmis odemenin iadesi. `amount` kurus (kismi iade icin daha dusuk tutar verin). `reason_code`: customer_request | out_of_stock | duplicate_charge | product_defect | fraud | wrong_amount | other.
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/payments/{{transaction_id}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
X-External-Merchant-Id: {{external_merchant_id}}

{
  "amount": 15000,
  "currency": "TRY",
  "reason": "Musteri talebi",
  "reason_code": "customer_request"
}

### Iptal (Void)
# Ayni gun (gun sonu kesimi oncesi) yapilmis odemeyi iptal eder. Gun sonu sonrasi Refund kullanin.
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/payments/{{transaction_id}}/void
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
X-External-Merchant-Id: {{external_merchant_id}}

{
  "reason": "Yanlis siparis"
}

### Siparis Linki Olustur (Order Link)
# Odeme linki olusturur; donen URL musteriye SMS/e-posta ile gonderilir.
# 
# DIKKAT: Bu uc **duz** alan alir — `amount` kurus cinsinden bir sayidir (25000 = 250,00 TL) ve `currency` ayri bir alandir. /payments ucundaki nested `amount: { amount, currency }` yapisi burada GECERSIZDIR.
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/payments/order-link
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
X-External-Merchant-Id: {{external_merchant_id}}

{
  "external_id": "ORDER-LINK-{{$timestamp}}",
  "amount": 25000,
  "currency": "TRY",
  "installment": 1,
  "description": "SMS/e-posta odeme linki",
  "customer_email": "musteri@ornek.com",
  "customer_phone": "5321234567"
}


########## 3D Secure

### 1. 3D Baslat (Init)
# 3D Secure baslatir. Cevapta `extra_properties.html_content` doner (bankanin auto-submit 3D formu).
# 
# **Yonlendirme:** `extra_properties.html_content`'i kart sahibinin tarayicisinda render edin (iframe `srcdoc` veya tam sayfa olarak yazin). Form yuklenince bankaya otomatik POST eder; musteri OTP/sifre dogrulamasini tamamlar. (Banka kendi sayfasini barindiriyorsa — hosted model — html_content bos gelir; o durumda `extra_properties.redirect_url`'e yonlendirin. Form-POST bankalarinda redirect_url bos olabilir.) Banka, Payven callback'ine (`/payments/3d/callback`) POST eder; Payven odemeyi finansallastirir ve tarayiciyi su parametrelerle (snake_case) geri yonlendirir:
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/payments/3d/init
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
X-External-Merchant-Id: {{external_merchant_id}}

{
  "external_id": "ORDER-3D-{{$timestamp}}",
  "amount": {
    "amount": 15000,
    "currency": "TRY"
  },
  "installment": 1,
  "operation_type": "sale",
  "card": {
    "holder_name": "TEST USER",
    "number": "5500000000000004",
    "expire_month": "12",
    "expire_year": "2030",
    "cvv": "123"
  },
  "buyer": {
    "id": "BUYER-001",
    "name": "Ahmet",
    "surname": "Yilmaz",
    "email": "ahmet@example.com",
    "phone": "+905551234567",
    "ip_address": "1.2.3.4"
  },
  "success_url": "https://magazaniz.com/odeme-basarili",
  "fail_url": "https://magazaniz.com/odeme-basarisiz"
}

### 2. (Opsiyonel) Manuel Complete
# Callback otomatik tamamlamasi yetersiz kaldiginda manuel finansallastirma. Cogu durumda gerekmez — banka callback'i odemeyi otomatik tamamlar.
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/payments/3d/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
X-External-Merchant-Id: {{external_merchant_id}}

{
  "transaction_id": "{{transaction_id}}",
  "need_verification": true
}

### 3. Sonuc Kontrolu (Get Payment)
# 3D akisindan sonra islemin son durumunu (`completed` / `failed`) sorgular.
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/payments/{{transaction_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


########## Hosted Checkout (Payven barindirilan sayfa)

### 1. Session Olustur
# Odeme oturumu olusturur. Cevapta `session_id`, `checkout_url`, `expires_at` doner. Musteriyi `checkout_url`'e yonlendirin.
# 
# `payment_mode`: non3_d | three_d_secure (default) | three_d_pay | three_d_pay_hosting.
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/checkout/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
X-External-Merchant-Id: {{external_merchant_id}}

{
  "merchant_name": "Ornek Magaza",
  "amount": 15000,
  "currency": "TRY",
  "allowed_installments": [1, 3, 6],
  "description": "Siparis #1001",
  "external_id": "ORDER-{{$timestamp}}",
  "customer_email": "musteri@example.com",
  "customer_phone": "+905551234567",
  "payment_mode": "three_d_secure",
  "success_url": "https://magazaniz.com/odeme/basarili",
  "cancel_url": "https://magazaniz.com/odeme/iptal"
}

### 2. Session Bilgisi (anonim)
# Checkout sayfasinin cagirdigi anonim endpoint (kart bilgisi icermez; merchant/tutar bilgisi doner). Token gerekmez.
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/checkout/sessions/{{session_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 3. Odeme Yontemleri (anonim)
# Session context'ine gore kullanilabilir odeme yontemlerini listeler.
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/checkout/sessions/{{session_id}}/payment-methods
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 4. Ode (anonim, checkout sayfasi)
# Checkout sayfasindaki MUSTERI tarafindan cagirilir (anonim — token yok, session ile gate'lenir). Session'dan tenant/merchant cozulur, 3D akisi tetiklenir. Bu istegi normalde Payven hosted sayfasi yapar; kendi sayfanizi yaziyorsaniz buradan cagirin.
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/checkout/sessions/{{session_id}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": {
    "amount": 15000,
    "currency": "TRY"
  },
  "installment": 1,
  "card": {
    "holder_name": "TEST USER",
    "number": "5500000000000004",
    "expire_month": "12",
    "expire_year": "2030",
    "cvv": "123"
  }
}

### 5. Islem Durumu Polling (anonim)
# Checkout sayfasinin 3D sonucunu polling etmesi icin.
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/checkout/sessions/{{session_id}}/transaction-status?transaction_id={{transaction_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


########## Recurring (Abonelik)

### Plan Olustur
# Yeni abonelik plani. `period`: daily | weekly | monthly | yearly. `secure_type`: three_ds | non_three_ds. `installment_count` toplam tahsilat adedi. ThreeDS ise cevaptaki `html_content` ile musteriyi bankaya yonlendirin.
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/recurring
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
X-External-Merchant-Id: {{external_merchant_id}}

{
  "external_id": "SUB-{{$timestamp}}",
  "amount": {
    "amount": 9900,
    "currency": "TRY"
  },
  "card": {
    "holder_name": "TEST USER",
    "number": "5500000000000004",
    "expire_month": "12",
    "expire_year": "2030",
    "cvv": "123"
  },
  "buyer": {
    "name": "Ahmet",
    "surname": "Yilmaz",
    "email": "ahmet@example.com"
  },
  "description": "Aylik abonelik",
  "period": "monthly",
  "interval": 1,
  "installment_count": 12,
  "secure_type": "non_three_ds",
  "return_url": "https://magazaniz.com/abonelik-sonucu"
}

### Planlari Listele
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/recurring?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Plan Detayi
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/recurring/{{recurring_plan_id}}?force_sync=false
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Plani Iptal Et
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/recurring/{{recurring_plan_id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
X-External-Merchant-Id: {{external_merchant_id}}

### Taksit Iptal Et
# Belirli bir taksiti (index) iptal eder.
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/recurring/{{recurring_plan_id}}/installments/2/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
X-External-Merchant-Id: {{external_merchant_id}}

### Taksit Tutari Guncelle
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/recurring/{{recurring_plan_id}}/installments/3/update-amount
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
X-External-Merchant-Id: {{external_merchant_id}}

{
  "amount": 12900
}

### Kart Son Kullanma Guncelle
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/recurring/{{recurring_plan_id}}/update-card-expiry
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
X-External-Merchant-Id: {{external_merchant_id}}

{
  "expire_month": "06",
  "expire_year": "2032"
}


########## Islemler (Transactions)

### Islemleri Listele
# Sayfalanmis islem listesi. Tarih filtrelerinde +03:00 offset ZORUNLU (offset'siz UTC kabul edilir, 3 saat kayar).
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/transactions?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Islem Detayi
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/transactions/{{transaction_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Islem Timeline (Histories)
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/transactions/{{transaction_id}}/histories
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### CSV Export
# Islemleri CSV (Excel uyumlu, UTF-8 BOM) olarak indirir.
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/transactions/export?page=1&page_size=1000
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### CSV Export
# Filtrelenmis islemleri CSV olarak indirir (UTF-8 BOM, Excel uyumlu; max 50.000 satir). Listeleme ile AYNI query filtrelerini kabul eder.
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/transactions/export?start_date=2026-05-01T00:00:00+03:00&end_date=2026-05-31T23:59:59+03:00
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


########## Webhook Abonelikleri

### Abonelik Olustur
# Webhook abonelik olusturur. `events` virgul-ayrik; bos birakilirsa tum event'ler. `url` HTTPS olmali (private/loopback IP'ler reddedilir). Cevaptaki `secret` HMAC imza dogrulamasi icin SADECE burada doner.
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/webhook-subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://magazaniz.com/webhooks/payven",
  "events": "payment.completed,payment.failed,refund.completed",
  "description": "ERP entegrasyonu",
  "max_retry_count": 5
}

### Abonelikleri Listele
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/webhook-subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Abonelik Guncelle
PUT {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/webhook-subscriptions/{{webhook_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://magazaniz.com/webhooks/payven",
  "events": "payment.completed,payment.failed",
  "description": "Guncellendi",
  "max_retry_count": 5
}

### Secret Yenile
# Yeni secret uretir (eski gecersiz olur). Yeni secret bir kez doner.
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/webhook-subscriptions/{{webhook_id}}/rotate-secret
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Pasif Et
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/webhook-subscriptions/{{webhook_id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Aktif Et
POST {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/webhook-subscriptions/{{webhook_id}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Teslimat Loglari
# Bir abonelige ait webhook teslimat denemelerini (HTTP status, retry, hata) listeler.
GET {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/webhook-subscriptions/{{webhook_id}}/deliveries
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Abonelik Sil
DELETE {{vpos_base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/webhook-subscriptions/{{webhook_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
